Value Filldown SHELF (\d+)
Value Filldown GROUP (\d+)
Value Filldown ONLINE_STATUS (\S+)
Value Filldown MODE (\S+)
Value Filldown FAN_NAME (.*?)
Value Filldown DIRECTION (\S+)
Value Required INDEX (\d+)
Value STATUS (.*?)
Value SPEED (\d+%?)

Start
  ^\s*\[shelf ${SHELF} LCC\]:
  ^\s*Group ${GROUP}:\s+${ONLINE_STATUS}
  ^\s*Fan speed mode:\s+${MODE}
  ^\s*Fan\s+name:\s+${FAN_NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*Fan\s+direction:\s+${DIRECTION}\s*$$
  ^\s*${INDEX}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SPEED}\s*$$ -> Record
